[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_BALLOONS]
Balloons

[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_BALLOONS_desc]
Even for a plane, a ship or a flying saucer, it is always a good thing to tie extra balloons to the fuselage. Of course, unless the enemy is equipped with darts.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_BALLOONS]
气球

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_BALLOONS_desc]
即使是飞机，飞船或是飞碟，在机体上捆绑额外的气球永远是好事情。当然，除非敌军装备了飞镖。
